{"id":"schweigen","lemma":"Schweigen","pos":"noun","rank":1344,"glosses":["silence (the lack of any sound or the lack of spoken communication)"],"ipa":"/ˈʃvaɪɡən/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/ae/De-Schweigen.ogg/De-Schweigen.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Schweigens"},"examples":[{"text":"Schweigen ist Gold.","en":"Silence is golden.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/394837","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"gold"}]},{"text":"Ich kann nicht länger schweigen.","en":"I can no longer remain silent.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"long","l":"lang"},null]},{"text":"Sie haben das Recht zu schweigen.","en":"You have the right to remain silent.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"right, right-hand"},{"g":"to / too"},null]},{"text":"Sein Schweigen hat mich überrascht.","en":"His silence surprised me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/789477","words":[{"g":"to be"},null,{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"surprised"}]},{"text":"Du wirst zum Schweigen gebracht werden.","en":"You'll be silenced.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"brought, carried"},{"g":"to become"}]}]}